  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s former five hundred years, Central Continent Gu Immortals take down Imperial Court Blessed Land, record the procedure, and release the recording across the five regions to display strength and poison northern plains’ mental support. The clip also shows Giant Sun Immortal Venerable snatching Gu across northern plains for his descendants; Huang Jin tribes keep open chaos below Central Continent hopes, yet hearts still waver.",
      "chapters": [
        559
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After seeing that video, Song Qie Xing gives an accurate prediction: once it spreads all over the region, the spirit of freedom in northern plains would be released from Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s prison.",
      "chapters": [
        559
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "accurate-prediction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan keeps a vivid memory of that recording and treats the clip as high-value reference for refining a portion of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building. He also judges that the public cut deleted scenes, so surface watching alone can mislead a refinement attempt.",
      "chapters": [
        559
      ],
